{"id":"abntex2-ufv","name":"abnTeX2-ufv","aliases":[],"caption":"Undergraduate thesis class for UFV (Brazil), based on abnTeX2","authors":[{"id":"smarzaro","active":true}],"copyright":[],"license":"lppl1.3c","version":{"number":"1.6.1","date":"2026-10-14"},"descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n     abntex2-ufv is a LaTeX class, built on top of the abnTeX2 class, for\n     undergraduate final theses (TCC) of the Information Systems program at the\n     Federal University of Viçosa (UFV), Rio Paranaíba campus, Brazil. It\n     implements the formatting rules of the UFV normalization manual (2026-2\n     edition; ABNT NBR 14724/2025, NBR 6023/2025 and NBR 10520/2023): page layout,\n     fonts, section headings, cover, title and approval pages, abstract, lists of\n     figures/tables/charts/code, acronym list (via acro), glossary,\n     figure/table/chart captions with source and notes, and BibLaTeX-abnt tweaks.\n     The class sets the defaults (12pt, A4, one-sided, Brazilian Portuguese) and\n     loads the packages every thesis needs. The customization package\n     abntex2-ufv.sty is loaded by the class; using it directly on top of abntex2 is\n     deprecated since version 1.5 and will be discontinued in version 2.0. The\n     documentation (in Portuguese) contains a complete example thesis, and an empty\n     template is included.\n    <\u002fp>"}],"documentation":[{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/latex/contrib/abntex2-ufv/README.md"},{"language":null,"details":"Package documentation","href":"ctan:/macros/latex/contrib/abntex2-ufv/doc/abntex2-ufv.pdf"}],"announce":"https://github.com/Smarzaro/abntex2-ufv/releases","bugs":"https://github.com/Smarzaro/abntex2-ufv/issues","repository":"https://github.com/Smarzaro/abntex2-ufv","ctan":{"path":"/macros/latex/contrib/abntex2-ufv","file":true},"miktex":"abntex2-ufv","texlive":"abntex2-ufv","topics":["doc-templ","portuguese-br","dissertation","class"],"also":["abntex2"]}